        "role": "user",
        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"ed55e0a7-abdc-4e3c-8a39-cb3026e77692\",\"review_text\":\"I have been using this app for over a year now and now all of a sudden when I am on my own playlist it just randomly plays song that aren't even ony playlist this NEEDS to get fixed. I don't care about my recommended songs I only care about mine\"},{\"review_id\":\"89c3a539-acf5-4783-b756-2ec87b8bea51\",\"review_text\":\"Best playlist ever Want to give 10 stars.😀😀😇😇\"},{\"review_id\":\"81868e09-57b4-42c2-8fe1-ae3b53d4d088\",\"review_text\":\"An amazing app for sure... I rated it a 5/5 for many reasons... It's easy to navigate and nice and smooth functioning.. My only suggestion would be downloading songs in free mode... That'd be great but about anything else it's a great app... 100% recommend... Thanks creators...\"},{\"review_id\":\"2b82f098-c5db-4500-baad-7eb7cfa669c0\",\"review_text\":\"Great!\"},{\"review_id\":\"4c18d22a-fb57-4376-b55e-a8b747089de1\",\"review_text\":\"Always logs me out whenever it updates. If this bothers anyone else, don't bother updating because there aren't any significant changes anyway and if there are it's always worse.\"},{\"review_id\":\"32412b6b-a67a-4d9d-bf1b-91dc00ba28bc\",\"review_text\":\"Love it\"},{\"review_id\":\"3a39e8ac-a51f-4d4a-840c-18c60259c88d\",\"review_text\":\"I dont like\"},{\"review_id\":\"29f4420a-a7dc-4360-ae0d-60744498a44e\",\"review_text\":\"Best app ever\"},{\"review_id\":\"86c70d81-9a6d-43a4-8ee4-05ebb636d3b4\",\"review_text\":\"Buffers a lot\"},{\"review_id\":\"32d0a12c-2b22-4fcf-a58e-b503fb935c31\",\"review_text\":\"Full of adds...third class app\"}]}"
